## Task Context
Modify backend/dal/index.js to add file locking using proper-lockfile.

### Current readFile (lines 61-69):
```javascript
async readFile(filePath) {
  try {
    const data = await fs.readFile(filePath, 'utf8');
    return JSON.parse(data);
  } catch (error) {
    console.error(`Error reading file ${filePath}:`, error);
    return [];
  }
}
```

### Current writeFile (lines 71-79):
```javascript
async writeFile(filePath, data) {
  try {
    await fs.writeFile(filePath, JSON.stringify(data, null, 2));
    return true;
  } catch (error) {
    console.error(`Error writing file ${filePath}:`, error);
    return false;
  }
}
```

### New pattern (both methods):
1. `const release = await lockfile.lock(filePath, { retries: { retries: 5, minTimeout: 50, maxTimeout: 500 } });`
2. Do the read/write
3. `finally { if (release) await release(); }`

Add `const lockfile = require('proper-lockfile');` after line 2.

